      "text": "Yeah, usually 6-12 or 2.  Varies.  It doesn't bother me though, I just need 4-5 hours of sleep and I'm good."
    },
    {
      "id": "07c68d828e15a545eb007a33935cbc0d3d8b84ca0c1b7061acd02f7c81730a58",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "I can trade feathers"
    },
    {
      "id": "d89db3251e4c95b1fe533a6f15e0d430c5e64d4673017920eaa3d8ccaa76abf6",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Clever haha! Did you get to bring her to college with you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "63df98a2875d338cd32a62f4bcad65ba46b8987af98e16e78c1ea3ddcd3c1342",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "You too!"
    },
    {
      "id": "b6a47d88db5458caec7269686200c47210d4d3ba6ff6af45ca60e72840cc295b",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Do you prefer fiction or nonfiction? Adventure or romance?  "
    },
    {
      "id": "ba1dc9d2322e2146222b94525a2c1302f2db3467e39ab4ee34c492eaaf038b60",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Nope"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9bb8d9395b7101432e7b7ccf0f7bef379aa171d66207295a3627cc5ea49a323",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "We have computers at school for our work but I don't have one at home.  I use the one at the library sometimes."
    },
    {
      "id": "023f0649afd7c9c7c4d3eaca86baa6426ba91bc6af1c792f951ee76dc2dfdde3",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "I lean more to classic rock but enjoy all gendres"
    },
    {
      "id": "312c2268c85a0777329a9c647543d1a289c453b25d0ff5be2b15a1b2e8ad1dc8",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Lol! Do you travel as well? My mother is a well known celebrity so we are always jumping from place to place."
    },
    {
      "id": "73bc032b12c2c2f563f8f349473e79f7f61ceecaefc352815fbb4fca7c48ce48",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "did you do anything fun for Halloween? "
    },
    {
      "id": "b7a0fd97223d6d93c28af4d2a4c77c27a396cd49cac75c2441c964816df2def3",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "I have on rare occasion. I strive for ~2 miles whenever I run so I'm no long distance runner by any means"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8452a5e2fb7a3604bd84ce776ee7b1f64be948e6c0229bd1ac3e5f96cb75e39",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "doberman mix"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6743da703149cbfe10520a63211d903be3e90cf924ea895ba37c6e63926c976",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Europe for sure"
    },
    {
      "id": "85dd3d55632bfd88e57ed618a37932f4c4b597b20f2e2598018dbe5a399d6b8b",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "nooo, he is super sweet and lazy because he's an old man"
    },
    {
      "id": "b84e41c0d3e71db05038d5a6364035eac1a3688a2090eb3b37ce74edd83b7939",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "I draw my siblings."
    },
    {
      "id": "53ba3ae7289f2c026e9a24e555d3013955dcf77394feaeaed710b7edb35ecaa3",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "I can only hope, do you eat carrots as well. I hear they are good for the eyes, but I don't eat them much myself"
    },
    {
      "id": "a58656063041325b700e840382079e2fbcf6af53ee4566c635099215e50beb58",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Do you spend much time with your family then?"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9b64c0ae4cbb6c614d7565b8ce11c21f312076e7ef67d330f7d12197882e8bc",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "All of the above HIIT was great when I was working, but now I'm freelance I can do whatever"
    },
    {
      "id": "16ab27bfd1e6cb32f0fa1a8ef4585e107dfb7fbf8483947b8d0f6580424445a4",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Look into what?  quilting?"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b30d6a6b6ee2ef068b333a42f5d87506440af40c32cdbe46e46f7c33f15432c",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Thanks, you're right! How about you? What do you want to do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "daedbb210f04abaf961539fc1b3ed88d9b2e42151c931f51ad6e11010a0ebbc1",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "it is. I was already old, but I have a 15 year old sister, and yes. It was so hard for her, for me too though."
    },
    {
      "id": "c3447895df7164ecbcf516b3af2989899e70992af7febab3633d61092a53cef8",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "i love all types of music. i use music to train at the gym and to relax at home. i'm sure you love live music too."
    },
    {
      "id": "5e84a05a45673a8908566025cfdf3298fe91a00a4d9c38d833d4869a8805dd63",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Constantly studying?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8c448d14bf60358534c582813e9f895e0a2b2ec80fb8fca7deba177dabeb110",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Same here, my daughter just turned 5 last month. Thankfully she hasn't mentioned wanting sibling yet."
    },
    {
      "id": "c0cd5e9d10e018b22845c4b611598fa3c84224f5f427a6e8fd3a13e438a0329a",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "oh wow, the shortest and the oldest. I am the youngest of five.  "
    },
    {
      "id": "479504990e5babe3c3494169f00cac54920a64534e6413c5f9eb81a9fd3d887b",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Its okay. That tragedy occurred 20 years ago. "
    },
    {
      "id": "c9c8dcf77b0d2b7221282a7a8b1cf8453ec9b677b0ca424ffc6daae543de0548",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "You should definitely wait till you are.  My two boys are a handfull.  But they are also the greatest reward."
    },
    {
      "id": "971d2c49f871940d99f2e299c33fccfb1edf4d5718b2a1889429be06daece2a9",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "That's kinda cool though! Never heard of a drum tat.. I recently got a tat of a no smoking sign. Celebrating 3 years of not smoking."
    },
    {
      "id": "cd6f04a8544982db661f2792ec270088315e52061502d9173e40c7468f90799e",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "How would one try to become an RN"
    },
    {
      "id": "810bcbd57f89e46a79dd2201ab811792c5fa8433c47b7bcedf1834d95cab7160",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "how was your day"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e9a04318018390f6086768df3aec3fd899fe177641356ddee524465756cff12",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Nice. I originally did weights for my training but I want to incorporate more cardio."
    },
    {
      "id": "f1cf9aba9a604e362fe466e48768eff847fe745a56a9faded6e6eece4c72887a",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "you sound like your busy"
    },
    {
      "id": "63b9ccde0c92a114ac69a93fda8a3b899431d1604c47ef54441af01f9f78d65c",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "yummy.! I would love to own a restaurant but I am sure it is a lot of work."
    },
    {
      "id": "63662aa11298388aa457a1f9e6961b58edd56eeea98cdbdbb185b86207df98c0",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "even i like story writting"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b1db8d1260ea752c71dce66a1c2fdee1493be96d999e03ee5912903d3cc6c6a",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Do you run competitively? "
    },
    {
      "id": "f85e6b1d2f63d4ecd5ae3e3fb786d5ec1aa4fe8645d36ba80945f354a1ce54ef",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "it took me a long time to accept my diagnosis, but im blessed now.  my partner also has it!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d1fd62afed4f4c8742c5e66f68970090be657c031ddf5049bf8a0610f433b5c",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "well I used to have a cat but she sadly died"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ba85c8138328312e1e5f384ac204133102d10e3027be8e7b6614e03f6c4e71a",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "I find it to be simple enough for me! My kids love the cats."
    },
    {
      "id": "908676c4f01dd33bde8041e8e81964024f69785c4ad034ff4fb586832280abca",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Nope, I've made it so far in one piece! Who is your favorite character?"
    },
    {
      "id": "85291f78eb88e9cafe94c60dbf298e4ac128390b669fc39c17ad5de8c31f5779",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "how did you get into that? that's talent"
    },
    {
      "id": "c53121f57cce704e7e2d9fd4a03b8b904d6a963caa9277c9f74caaa7878c5270",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Good point. I may have to distract myself with other things, what do you think "
    },
    {
      "id": "f39c0e7c6fd9f54bc11ceeb7e5b23162c742639768198ed412f79deb3ac3cf29",
      "source": "en",
      "target": "es",
      "text": "Criminal law. What about you?"
    }
  ],
